Kill Dull full-site review build
Source: build/homepage-sept-7 @ bcd8d493f3eb4031b27750df6b9002cf1871a425
Purpose: single review build for the entire site.

LAUNCH BLOCKER — INDEXING IS OFF, DELIBERATELY.
This build must not be indexed. Two things hold that, and BOTH have to be
lifted together when the site launches. Lifting only one leaves the site
still hidden.

  1. vercel.json  "headers"
     X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
     is served on /(.*) — every page and every asset.
  2. Every public page carries <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
     index, discipline, bench, readings, bureau, accessibility, privacy,
     terms, faq.

Also at launch: robots.txt exists in the repository but is NOT deployed —
.vercelignore excludes the repository root and never re-includes it. It reads
"Disallow: /", so it must be corrected before it is ever added to the deploy.

Nothing else gates indexing. Do not remove either item above for a review.
